Association StaffEducationOrganizationContactAssociation [2675]
    documentation 'This association provides the contact information of the staff associated with the education organization.
    domain entity Staff [2681]
        documentation 'The Staff assigned to the EducationOrganization.
    domain entity EducationOrganization [2682]
        documentation 'The EducationalOrganization to which the Staff member provides services.
    include Address [2676]
        documentation 'The optional address for the contact associated with the EducationOrganizationunique.
        is optional
    shared string ContactTitle named ContactTitle [2677]
        documentation 'The title of the contact in the context of the EducationOrganization
        is optional
    descriptor ContactType [2678]
        documentation 'Indicates the type for the contact information.
        is part of identity
    include ElectronicMail [2679]
        documentation 'The optional email for the contact associated with the EducationOrganization.
        is required
    include Telephone [2680]
        documentation 'The optional telephone for the contact association with the EducationOrganization.
        is optional
        
    
        